id: S11
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: recodeScalarRadix16: digit-range constant narrowed, high-nibble mask 'and 0xF' -> 'and 0x7' for the odd-indexed digits.
====OLD====
    result[2 * i + 1] = int32((s[i] shr 4) and 0xF)
====NEW====
    result[2 * i + 1] = int32((s[i] shr 4) and 0x7)
====END====
